# Public origin used to build absolute URLs for social preview tags.
#
# Open Graph requires an ABSOLUTE og:image URL — a relative path silently yields
# no preview card on Slack, LinkedIn, X or Facebook. Vite substitutes
# %VITE_SITE_URL% in index.html at build time, so the deployed host lives here
# and nowhere else.
#
# Change this one line after the first deploy, then rebuild.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://keepsake.tariqkhan.dev
